        "prompt": "$35.5\\div3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$11.8\\dot{3}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{array}{r|rrrrrrr}&1&1&.&8&3&3&\\cdots\\\\\\hline 3&3&5&.&{}^{2}5&{}^{1}0&{}^{1}0&\\cdots\\end{array}$$\nThe remainder $1$ repeats, so the digit $3$ repeats.\n$$35.5\\div3=11.8\\dot{3}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 35
      },
      {
        "id": "p91-q3-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$7.1\\div0.3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$23.\\dot{6}$",
          "worked": "$$7.1\\div0.3=71\\div3$$\n$$\\begin{array}{r|rrrrrrr}&2&3&.&6&6&6&\\cdots\\\\\\hline 3&7&{}^{1}1&.&{}^{2}0&{}^{2}0&{}^{2}0&\\cdots\\end{array}$$\nThe remainder $2$ repeats, so the digit $6$ repeats.\n$$7.1\\div0.3=23.\\dot{6}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 39
      },
      {
        "id": "p91-q3-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$287\\div1.2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$239.1\\dot{6}$",
          "worked": "$$287\\div1.2=2870\\div12$$\n$$\\begin{array}{r|rrrrrrrr}& &2&3&9&.&1&6&6\\\\\\hline 12&2&8&{}^{4}7&{}^{11}0&.&{}^{2}0&{}^{8}0&{}^{8}0\\end{array}$$\nThe remainder $8$ repeats, so the digit $6$ repeats.\n$$287\\div1.2=239.1\\dot{6}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 46
      }
    ]
